content:
Help me find the associations.  

#### Data:
These are the extracted domain objects and their associations:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Business Owner",
      "description": "Person submitting and managing the company’s certification request",
      "attributes": [
        "Company"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Company",
      "description": "Business seeking certification"
    },
    {
      "name": "Certification Application",
      "description": "Application used to request certification",
      "attributes": [
        "Compliance Document",
        "Auditor"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Compliance Document",
      "description": "File showing the company meets certain standards"
    },
    {
      "name": "Auditor",
      "description": "Person reviewing documents and doing on site checks"
    },
    {
      "name": "Audit Coordinator",
      "description": "Person assigning auditors and handling scheduling"
    },
    {
      "name": "On Site Audit",
      "description": "Inspection at the company location"
    },
    {
      "name": "Audit Report",
      "description": "Write up of the auditor’s findings"
    },
    {
      "name": "Certification Board Member",
      "description": "Person deciding if the company gets certified"
    },
    {
      "name": "Certification Decision",
      "description": "Outcome issued after reviewing the audit."
    },
    {
      "name": "Compliance Officer",
      "description": "Person supporting the business with follow up steps"
    },
    {
      "name": "Follow Up Messaging",
      "description": "Messages helping the business fix issues"
    },
    {
      "name": "Evaluation Meeting",
      "description": "Meeting to talk through audit issues"
    }
  ]
}
```

#### Task:
- Draw connections between objects that have an association. 
- Name each object and add a description that captures the meaning of the association.
- Return the associations in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "associations": [
    {
      "from": "...",
      "to": "...",
      "description": "..."
    }
  ]
}
```

Here are the associations:
```json
{
  "associations": [
    {
      "from": "Business Owner",
      "to": "Certification Application",
      "description": "Business Owner creates the Certification Application to begin the process"
    },
    {
      "from": "Audit Coordinator",
      "to": "Certification Application",
      "description": "Audit Coordinator checks the Certification Application to assign an auditor"
    },
    {
      "from": "Audit Coordinator",
      "to": "Auditor",
      "description": "Audit Coordinator assigns an Auditor to the case"
    },
    {
      "from": "Auditor",
      "to": "Compliance Document",
      "description": "Auditor reviews each Compliance Document for compliance issues"
    },
    {
      "from": "Auditor",
      "to": "On Site Audit",
      "description": "Auditor performs the On Site Audit at the company"
    },
    {
      "from": "Auditor",
      "to": "Audit Report",
      "description": "Auditor creates the Audit Report after finishing the checks"
    },
    {
      "from": "Audit Report",
      "to": "Compliance Officer",
      "description": "Audit Report is passed to the Compliance Officer for follow up"
    },
    {
      "from": "Certification Board Member",
      "to": "Audit Report",
      "description": "Certification Board Member reviews the Audit Report to make a decision"
    },
    {
      "from": "Certification Board Member",
      "to": "Certification Decision",
      "description": "Certification Board Member issues the Certification Decision"
    },
    {
      "from": "Certification Decision",
      "to": "Certification Application",
      "description": "Certification Decision is tied to the Certification Application as its result"
    },
    {
      "from": "Compliance Officer",
      "to": "Follow Up Messaging",
      "description": "Compliance Officer sends Follow Up Messaging to guide improvements"
    },
    {
      "from": "Compliance Officer",
      "to": "Evaluation Meeting",
      "description": "Compliance Officer sets up the Evaluation Meeting with the business"
    },
    {
      "from": "Business Owner",
      "to": "Follow Up Messaging",
      "description": "Business Owner receives the Follow Up Messaging for next steps"
    },
    {
      "from": "Business Owner",
      "to": "Evaluation Meeting",
      "description": "Business Owner joins the Evaluation Meeting to review issues"
    }
  ]
}
```
